===Honest Jimmy===
{{main|Honest Jimmy's House of Stuff}}
You can also talk to [[Honest Jimmy]] to use your [[pieces of eight]] and get some unique items such as naval clothing, pirate banners, [[the stuff]] (which increases the chance of getting a mature ale from personal [[Brewing|brewing]]), and [[rum (Trouble Brewing)|rum]] (acts as a consumable teleport to the Trouble Brewing area).  It takes 39,590 points to purchase all items from the shop. 

